{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "16676bee3ab3586bb34dc28fdb731bdce5efc77d79478885fd975ed4a9eac42e", "ja": "意外なふたり？", "zh": "意想不到的两人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea3011698dbe8e3d5a096659c7d435ca574139907ff7f55c5f19ae4ce9f8d696", "ja": "最近多忙なプロデューサー。社長から託され\nたデュオ曲の歌い手に、ジュリアと恵美を選\nぶ。真新しさもあるが、相性もよさそうと語\nるプロデューサーの言葉通り、ふたりはすぐ\nに意気投合する。", "zh": "最近忙碌不堪的制作人，将社长委托的二重唱曲目的演唱人选定为茱莉亚和恵美。正如制作人所说，两人不仅有新鲜感，看起来也很合拍，果然很快就一拍即合了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab77c8300fa0db2b8dfee5ce36758fdf22a6dae323c9de98cd917d90de0370f0", "ja": "……というワケで、ジュリア、恵美。\nふたりにデュオを組んでもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "……事情就是这样，茱莉亚、惠美。\n我想让你们两个人组成双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c78ce4aec223568395bad1c43ed8e7fb9cb4ec70c35cd9eca8c70a1354f2d2f", "ja": "へえ？　ウチらがデュオ、ねぇ……", "zh": "哦？让我们组成双人组合啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "3acc6111e211b83d9dc3d49e83fb0354fd11e5d6bb2a7156f06cfd3067d7838d", "ja": "そういえばアタシとジュリアって、\nユニットとかは全然やってないよね？　珍しいかも。", "zh": "这么说来，我和茱莉亚好像完全没组成过双人组合吧？可能还挺少见的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "4a5f050c41e3f9ff74cccc033870664415a46fa067c4f98ea8757b23d0d4dad9", "ja": "だな。別に特別な理由とかはないんだけど……\nなんとなく縁がなかったよな。", "zh": "是啊。也没什么特别的理由……就是总觉得没什么缘分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b4d4ac2db40c79fc9b74b461ea0d0f78a7a07ca643e195932b09f575aeffe6d2", "ja": "まさしく、その真新しさを狙ったんだよ。\nそれだけじゃなくて、相性もいいと思うけどな。", "zh": "正是看中了那份新鲜感。\n不只是这样，我觉得它们也很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "fac96f20e96f1a94d46af4f2d5543a8e1522371a8817ac1f786e0dc23ffdcb4e", "ja": "えっ？　うーん……そうか？", "zh": "诶？嗯……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "205e7647764005e05fac69ccd59a6129ba823f1b601433382ef0ed803b801528", "ja": "ジュリア～！？　その発言ってどうなの！\nアイドル活動、一緒にやってきた仲間じゃん！", "zh": "茱莉亚～！？你这话是怎么回事啊！\n我们可是一起进行偶像活动的伙伴啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "5b0647d7fd1d77ac071c481c00a85741cdd993c9bd56c7f73b235f30d65fb9af", "ja": "バンドの時、楽器教えてもらったりとか……。\nもうマブダチだと思ってたのに～！", "zh": "组乐队的时候，你还教过我乐器什么的……我都以为我们已经是最好的朋友了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba408ae497fa66095f34d2b3a8a5d8dafccf24f22273dbb7e798f69bbb0434c2", "ja": "あ、いや、そうじゃなくて！\nフツーに気は合うと思ってるって。結構な。", "zh": "啊，不是，我不是那个意思！  \n我只是觉得我们平时挺合得来的。相当合得来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "f50d2dac042ce0c8a615b72bc1025ecdf4ff26cc201abd6efaa61f269b6733c8", "ja": "ただ、ユニットとしての相性って言われると、\nまだピンとは来てないっつーか……そんだけだっての。", "zh": "不过，要说作为组合的契合度，我还没什么实感……只是这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "30748b610023206d04a20558b5a1c2a5a069c9e6bbbb47672563b4e8fbaa77a5", "ja": "ピッタリだと思うよ。プロデューサーとしての、\nただの勘だけど。どうかな？　ふたりとも。", "zh": "我觉得你们非常合适。虽然只是作为制作人的直觉……你们觉得呢？俩人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "736153df2a8ca8a3dcd53547a6d13b2068b33627fa191a52bb4934889738e81c", "ja": "やるやる！　アタシはやるよ。\nジュリアもやろうよ～、楽しそうじゃん！", "zh": "我要去我要去！我去参加。\n茱莉亚也一起去嘛～，听起来很有意思啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "457487f8f7c497c1cc798f4850d8d0098e4ba2efc4c62e52f44e8344d07aa779", "ja": "ま、大事なのはそれだよな……わかったわかった。\nいいぜ、あんたの狙いにノッてやるよ♪", "zh": "嘛，关键就是这个对吧……知道了知道了。\n行啊，我就顺着你的计划来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "480b722ebeee094c8ba96842f21db1e1a6b9b840b907d15f85c8cf2a433e2784", "ja": "ありがとう！　それじゃ早速ミーティングを……っと、\nその前に、謝らないといけないことがあるんだ。", "zh": "谢谢！那么事不宜迟，我们马上开会……啊不对，\n在这之前，我有件事必须向你道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "ffdf42f9a5ccce2df74984d2ed581a8240e4d7eb2b21aabfa9c8ed5a1e96965d", "ja": "えっ、な、なんだよ……まさか、\nメチャクチャ恥ずかしい衣装とか、歌詞とか？", "zh": "诶，什、什么啊……该不会是，\n特别羞耻的服装，或者歌词之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "b5f237b8fcf4e38e3433217c05033116b8a543342b76aebafcf1aabb393879aa", "ja": "そーなの？　アタシは別にNGないけど……。\nでも、あんまりやらしいのはな～。", "zh": "是这样吗？我倒是没什么不能接受的……不过，太色气的可不行啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "86ef4b89790d268b6a46c19c79d0eed52c5422de41cadd8444b15417c74d52c1", "ja": "いや、違うから！　最近ちょっと忙しくてな、\nあんまりサポートできないかもなんだよ。", "zh": "不是，你想哪去了！最近我有点忙，\n可能没法帮上太多忙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d3aae11c051e43b51cca34c8497498f641c86c9a290e866d280d0498cc04e805", "ja": "ふたりに任せるところも多くなると思う。\nそれでも大丈夫か？", "zh": "我想今后会有很多地方要交给你们两个。\n这样也没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "56b871bfff31007d69079f065b4e76b2579d949193e5a98f2a86ff020ae3bc8b", "ja": "なーんだ、そんだけ？\nヘーキヘーキ！　子どもじゃないんだから～。", "zh": "什么嘛，就这点事？\n没问题没问题！我们又不是小孩子了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "8abf7eaf6df204abe047aa59a189aa0f3c881966df8d5d8001ebd81efae539e6", "ja": "ん？　あっ……そういうことか！\n手間が掛からないって理由で、ウチらを選んだだろ？", "zh": "嗯？啊……原来是这么回事啊！\n你是图省事，才选了我们对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c95e70210b033b8578f33fabb07b48b8652d69d3f4d986e8165683a29ae8ed94", "ja": "うっ……！？　急に鋭い……。\nまあ、ふたりがしっかり者だからっていうのはあるな。", "zh": "呃……！？突然变得这么敏锐……\n不过，确实也有你们两个都很靠得住这层原因在就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "44ce8a5b77f8da26dfd2f09fa65c7301a23512dcc76c7623eb103ff68759d498", "ja": "えーっ、それってひどくない？\nなんか、都合がいい感じ～。", "zh": "诶——这也太过分了吧？\n总觉得你还真会挑对自己方便的说法～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "de370abdb89d28f873af3752351115df9526ee6582499b4ed6df334e729dea41", "ja": "い、いや、あくまで理由のひとつってだけで……！\nふたりが相性よさそうなのは本当だからな！", "zh": "不、不是，那充其量只是理由之一啦……！\n你们两个合得来也是真的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "e830e8af32351b001b6e4b381ea483e040f3669d97e500857b8929524c73ae08", "ja": "……なーんて、うそうそ！　冗談だって。\n任せといてよ、ジュリアとうまくやってみせるから。", "zh": "……逗你的啦，骗你的！开玩笑而已。\n交给我吧，我会和茱莉亚好好相处的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "19c66c9dc5ddb9283644f06001f082bb883df358ba0e1f207364b53065d98609", "ja": "あたしも二言はないさ。カンペキにこなして、\nビックリさせてやる。見とけよ、バカP！", "zh": "我也说到做到。会完美搞定，让你大吃一惊。看好了，笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "fd9323a65e992f30364d7004dc6b24f1c09428a4958c3ee2efe5753aff9a3f32", "ja": "ふたりとも……ありがとう。", "zh": "你们两个……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "d8f732f3f0408e5a54ac223973312a28f1399951e2c0c63c755877255c1e20ce", "ja": "にゃはは♪　けどさ～、{$P$}、\nホント忙しそうだよね～？　みんな心配してるよ。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪ 不过啊～{$P$}，\n你看起来真的很忙呢～？大家都很担心你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "9961cd96216ce93a9375ec001724701229fc1dee44261efad5ec591e379f4fa8", "ja": "えっ、そんなに？\n気にさせちゃってるなら、申し訳ないなぁ……。", "zh": "咦，有那么忙吗？\n要是让大家担心了，还真是不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "72632ab7fc67b01e432eca1814f82efe09613df119770a7544ac731dc8f2cf08", "ja": "ウチらのフォローとかいいから、\n休める時はしっかり休んどけよ？　ったく。", "zh": "不用顾虑我们这些，能休息的时候就好好休息，知道吗？真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "61419064ecb29ec3319c665f8b8297d7e55cc7d7cceeb06942a8fcb5b8f6405c", "ja": "（そんなに疲れて見えるのかな？　近いうちに、\n何かリフレッシュした方がいいかもしれない……）", "zh": "（我看起来有那么累吗？最近找个时间放松一下或许会比较好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
